# What `docker build` may NOT see (the build context is the repo root). Two reasons:
# 1. Secrets: an env file copied into an image is published with the image. Never.
# 2. Size and speed: .venv alone is ~5.7 GB with the RL packages.
.env*
!.env.example
*~
.git
.github
.venv
venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
dist
lab
tests
web/node_modules
web/.next
web/public/monaco
web/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
docs
**/*.safetensors
**/*.bin
